{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1477676-aberrant-weighted-weapon-tag","id":1477676,"title":"[Aberrant] Weighted Weapon Tag","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Aberrant"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-03-30T03:54:15-07:00","id":1477676,"title":"[Aberrant] Weighted Weapon Tag","content":"I'm trying to wrap my head around this system. For the most part, I think I get it. I'm lost when it comes to the Weighted weapon tag, however, especially when combined with Forceful Martial Arts. <br /> <br /> The Trip/Knockdown stunt says it costs 1 success.<br /> <br /> The weighted tag says it reduces the cost of the Trip/Knockdown stunt by 2 successes.<br /> <br /> Forceful Martial Arts 1 doubles that reduction.<br /> <br /> How does that work when the stunt only costs 1 success anyway?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/16564-zombiegenesis","name":"ZombieGenesis","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-30T04:16:33-07:00","id":1477678,"title":"","content":"I have 2 suggestions:<br /> <br /> Change the tag:<br /> Weighted (1): This tag grants 2 enhancements that can be used only with the Knock Down/Trip and Shove Stunts.<br /> <br /> Change the stunt Trip/Knockdown to something closer to the complicated stunt.<br /> <br /> Trip/Knockdown (1+ successes): you unbalance the target causing a complication of same cost as the successes invested in this stunt. As long the complication is not bought off, the target is considered down (prone or facing the ground).<br /> <br /> If you use weighted weapon you get +2 complication and combined with FMA +4.","signatur